380
00:16:11,888 --> 00:16:13,014
Seeing what?

381
00:16:14,182 --> 00:16:16,184
You do remember
that we kissed, right?

382
00:16:16,767 --> 00:16:17,768
I remember.

383
00:16:19,145 --> 00:16:20,897
It will be okay.

384
00:16:34,869 --> 00:16:35,870
